type: software
title: "AIMLS: AI Manuscript Labelling System"
abstract: >-
  Open notation system and single-file web tool that produces a graphic label
  and a matching prose declaration of artificial intelligence use in manuscripts, built on the STM (2025) classification of nine activities.
